---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import Card from '../components/ProductCard.astro';import {products,series} from '../lib/data';import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';const news=(await getCollection('news',x=>!x.data.isDemo)).sort((a,b)=>b.data.publishedAt.localeCompare(a.data.publishedAt));
---
<Base><section class="home-intro"><div class="intro-copy"><div class="eyebrow">HANGE ZOË / ハンジ・ゾエ</div><h1>关于韩吉，<br/>一件一件地记录。</h1><p>官方周边、发行记录与角色资料。<br/>为每一件收藏，留下一份有出处的档案。</p><form class="search-bar" action="/merch/"><label class="sr-only" for="home-search">搜索周边</label><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="home-search" name="q" placeholder="搜商品、系列或品牌，支持中 / 日 / 英文"/><button>搜索图录</button></form><div class="search-hints"><span>试试：</span><a href="/merch/?q=1123">黏土人 1123</a><a href="/merch/?q=ハンジ">ハンジ</a></div></div><aside class="archive-note"><span class="note-number">01 / ARCHIVE</span><div class="glasses" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></div><h2>让喜欢有迹可循。</h2><p>只记录发行时官方价格<br/>区分初版、再贩与不同版本<br/>未知的信息，留待核实</p><div class="note-bottom">非官方 · 持续收录</div></aside></section><div class="archive-stats"><div><strong>{products.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</strong><span>已收录周边</span></div><div><strong>{series.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</strong><span>系列档案</span></div><div><strong>{products.reduce((n,p)=>n+p.releases.length,0).toString().padStart(2,'0')}</strong><span>发行记录</span></div><p>从小小的档案开始，<br/>慢慢补全每一段记录。</p></div><section><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE COLLECTION</span><h2>最新收录</h2></div><a href="/merch/">浏览全部周边</a></div><div class="home-catalog"><div class="product-grid">{products.slice(0,4).map(p=><Card product={p}/>)}</div><aside class="collection-note"><span class="eyebrow">收藏之前，先看出处</span><h3>同一件周边，<br/>可以有不同发行记录。</h3><p>原价跟随每次发行保存。整盒、盲抽和特典，各自保留官方公布的单位。</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">了解收录规则</a></aside></div></section><section class="two-columns"><div><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SERIES FILES</span><h2>系列档案</h2></div><a href="/series/">全部系列</a></div>{series.map((s,i)=><a class="series-row" href={'/series/'+s.slug+'/'}><span class="row-number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.type} · 日本 · {products.filter(p=>p.seriesId===s.id).length} 件周边</p></div><span>查看档案</span></a>)}</div><div><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">NEWS & RELEASES</span><h2>发行资讯</h2></div><a href="/news/">全部资讯</a></div>{news.slice(0,3).map(n=><a class="news-row" href={'/news/'+n.data.slug+'/'}><small>{n.data.category} · {n.data.publishedAt}</small><h3>{n.data.title}</h3><p>{n.data.summary}</p></a>)}</div></section><section class="wiki-strip"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE COLLECTION</span><h2>不止是周边，也是韩吉。</h2><p>名称索引、基础资料与登场记录，逐条核对，慢慢整理。</p></div><a class="button light" href="/wiki/">阅读 Wiki</a></section></Base>
